ersioning: optimistic\n    Consistency: serial-per-list\n    Durability: durable\n    Entities: todolist, task, membership, invitation\n\nTYPE REFERENCE\n  due (variant): date-only localdate | at zoneddatetime\n  listid (opaque text)\n  role (enum): owner | editor | viewer\n  task (record):\n    id: TASKID\n    list: LISTID\n    title: (TEXT :MIN 1 :MAX 500)\n    notes: (TEXT :MAX 20000)\n    status: TASKSTATUS\n    state: TASKSTATE\n    due: (OPTIONAL DUE)\n    assignee: (OPTIONAL USERID)\n    version: VERSION\n  taskid (opaque text)\n  taskstate (enum): active | trashed\n  taskstatus (enum): open | completed\n  todolist (record):\n    id: LISTID\n    title: (TEXT :MIN 1 :MAX 200)\n    owner: USERID\n    version: VERSION\n  userid (opaque text)\n  version (opaque integer)\n\nBEHAVIORAL REFERENCE\n  create-task (todo-service/create-task):\n    Actor: USER\n    Reads: memberships, todo-lists\n    Writes: tasks\n    Atomic scope: (LIST REQUEST / LIST)\n    Idempotency: command-key\n    Preconditions:\n      (AUTHENTICATED? USER)\n      (MAY-EDIT-LIST? PRE USER REQUEST / LIST)\n    Postconditions:\n      (= POST (INSERT-TASK PRE REQUEST RESULT))\n    Failures:\n      forbidden when (NOT (MAY-EDIT-LIST? PRE USER REQUEST / LIST)), preserves all-state\n    Emissions:\n      (TASK-CREATED :EXACTLY-ONCE-LOGICALLY)\n\n  invite-user (todo-service/invite):\n    Actor: USER\n    Reads: memberships, invitations\n    Writes: invitations\n    Atomic scope: (LIST-MEMBERSHIP REQUEST / LIST)\n    Idempotency: command-key\n    Preconditions:\n      (OWNER? PRE USER REQUEST / LIST)\n      (< (OTHER-PRINCIPAL-COUNT PRE REQUEST / LIST) 256)\n    Postconditions:\n      (= POST (INVITE-PRINCIPAL PRE REQUEST))\n    Failures:\n      sharing-limit when (= (OTHER-PRINCIPAL-COUNT PRE REQUEST / LIST) 256), preserves all-state\n\n\nOBLIGATIONS\n  atomic-boundaries\n  durable-commit\n  retry-safety\n\nPROHIBITIONS\n  choose-unpinned-dependencies\n  perform-network-io\n\nAUTHORIZED FILES\n(\"genera